visional: awaiting the client&#x27;s own value (D-11).">Provisional</div></span></div><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Declared extension point for interest-rate risk in the banking book.</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-muted-foreground" data-testid="module-planned-note">Planned extension point: declared so runs and reports can name it, not implemented in this release. It cannot be selected for a run and is not production-ready.</p><dl class="mt-3 grid grid-cols-[160px_1fr] gap-y-1 text-sm"><dt class="text-muted-foreground">Input schemas</dt><dd><span class="font-mono text-xs">instrument</span></dd><dt class="text-muted-foreground">Rules</dt><dd><span class="text-muted-foreground">None</span></dd><dt class="text-muted-foreground">Module version ID</dt><dd><span class="break-all font-mono text-xs">33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333</span></dd></dl></li>"`;
